# Only the ward of "creatures your opponents control" is switched off. Bot1 controls both Nowhere to Run and a Sedgemoor Witch
# (Ward - Pay 3 life), so when Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets the Witch the ward ability triggers as ever: Bot2 declines to
# pay, the Bolt is countered and the Witch is undamaged.

